      "mergeID": "6138114a78c9235507f6f07e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Player voice audio and, according to others, world audio as well under certain situations will without warning suddenly start sounding like they're right next to you regardless of distance and coming from the wrong side. I don't know the technical details of this but some have mentioned it occuring because of too many audio sources happening at once in an instance. Restarting the game appears to temporarily fix it. If anyone else has a clue on how to help figure this out, leaving a comment for the devs down below would be appreciated.\nVideo, pay attention to Zodiac the nanachi on the left when they speak, as well as B-The-Bot towards the end of the video.\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/c4fnxg.mp4",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1128] Player voice audio (and world audio) becomes 2D and channels inverted under certain situations",
